---

<BaseLayout locale={locale} pageKey="home" path="/" schema="home">
  <link slot="head" rel="preload" as="image" href={IMG.uiHero.url} fetchpriority="high" />
  <Navigation slot="header" locale={locale} currentPath={`/${locale}/`} />

  <!-- ============ HERO (editorial: magazine cover, 3-col, with image bleed) ============ -->
  <!-- 2026-10-14 P1-editorial-2: magazine-cover treatment — column rule on left,
       Vol/FW metadata in top-right, image bleeds below the fold, decorative
       ornament between kicker and h1, all type in serif with italic accents. -->
  <section class="home-enhanced-hero relative bg-background text-foreground overflow-hidden">

    <!-- Top-right magazine metadata (desktop only) — small uppercase tracking -->
    <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 right-8 xl:right-12 z-20 text-right">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground/55">
        {locale === 'cn' ? '卷 24 · 羊绒特辑 · 二〇二六秋冬季' : locale === 'ja' ? 'Vol. XXIV · カシミア特集 · 2026-27 AW' : locale === 'kr' ? 'Vol. XXIV · 캐시미어 특집 · 2026-27 F/W' : 'Vol. XXIV · Cashmere Atelier · 2026-27 F/W'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Background image: large portrait on right, bleeds below the section (overlaps metrics) -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden lg:block" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 h-[110%] w-[50%] overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src={IMG.uiHero.url}
          width={IMG.uiHero.w}
          height={IMG.uiHero.h}
          alt="Premium cashmere coat on Ordos highland — material-led B2B collection inspiration"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <!-- Soft cream-to-transparent gradient on the left so the image
             blends into the text-side background; deeper fade at top-right
             to anchor the magazine metadata. -->
        <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-background via-background/80 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-background/60 to-transparent"></div>
        <!-- Bottom-edge fade so image bleeds smoothly into next section -->
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-background to-transparent"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- Image caption (editorial credit), positioned under the image in the column -->
      <p class="absolute bottom-6 right-8 xl:right-12 z-20 max-w-md text-right font-serif italic text-[11px] text-foreground/60 leading-snug">
        {locale === 'cn' ? '封面：内蒙古高原，2026 拍摄。模特身着本厂 100% 羊绒双面呢大衣。' : locale === 'ja' ? '表紙：内モンゴル高原、2026年撮影。モデル：本工場製 100% カシミア ダブルフェイス コート。' : locale === 'kr' ? '표지: 내몽골 고원, 2026 촬영. 모델은 본 공장 100% 캐시미어 더블페이스 코트.' : 'Cover: Inner Mongolian highland, FW 2026. Model wears 100% cashmere double-face coat, woven in our Ordos atelier.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src={IMG.uiHero.url}
        width={IMG.uiHero.w}
        height={IMG.uiHero.h}
        alt="Premium cashmere on Ordos highland"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-background/40 via-background/30 to-background"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative container-narrow min-h-[92vh] flex items-center py-28 lg:py-40">
      <div class="relative max-w-2xl pl-8 lg:pl-12">
        <!-- Vertical column rule (magazine masthead accent) -->
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-2 bottom-2 w-px bg-brand-copper/40" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <!-- Italic serif eyebrow (kicker) -->
        <p class="font-serif italic text-sm md:text-base text-brand-copper mb-6 tracking-wide">
          {locale === 'cn' ? '鄂尔多斯 · 自有工厂 · 二〇〇二年建' : locale === 'ja' ? 'オルドス · 自社工場 · 2002年創業' : locale === 'kr' ? '오르도스 · 자가 공장 · 2002년 설립' : locale === 'de' ? 'Ordos · Eigene Manufaktur · Gegründet 2002' : locale === 'fr' ? 'Ordos · Usine propre · Fondée en 2002' : 'Ordos · Self-owned mill · Est. 2002'}
        </p>

        <!-- Decorative ornament (small typographic flourish) -->
        <div class="font-serif italic text-brand-copper/60 text-2xl mb-2 select-none" aria-hidden="true">§</div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-[5.5rem] 2xl:text-[6.5rem] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.025em] mb-10 text-foreground" set:html={c.title.replace(/\n/g, '<br/>')} />

        <!-- Italic serif sub-kicker -->
        <p class="font-serif italic text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-foreground/70 mb-14 leading-snug max-w-lg">
          {locale === 'cn' ? '原料 · 纱线 · 面料 · 针织成衣 — 一座工厂完成每一道工序。' : locale === 'ja' ? '原料・糸・生地・ニット — 一つの工場で全工程を。' : locale === 'kr' ? '원료, 원사, 직물, 니트웨어 — 한 공장에서 모든 공정을. ' : 'From raw fiber to finished knitwear — under one roof in Inner Mongolia.'}
        </p>

        <!-- 1 primary + 2 text-link CTAs -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-6 sm:gap-10">
          <a href={`/${locale}/contact/`} class="btn-tier-1 group">
            {c.cta}
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href={`/${locale}/download/`} class="font-serif italic text-base md:text-lg text-foreground border-b border-foreground/40 hover:border-brand-copper hover:text-brand-copper pb-0.5 transition-colors">
            {locale === 'cn' ? '下载目录 ↗' : locale === 'ja' ? 'カタログをダウンロード ↗' : locale === 'kr' ? '카탈로그 다운로드 ↗' : 'Download catalog ↗'}
          </a>
          <a href="#home-catalog" class="font-serif italic text-base md:text-lg text-foreground border-b border-foreground/40 hover:border-brand-copper hover:text-brand-copper pb-0.5 transition-colors">
            {locale === 'cn' ? '查看产品中心' : locale === 'ja' ? '製品を見る' : locale === 'kr' ? '제품 보기' : locale === 'de' ? 'Produkte ansehen' : locale === 'fr' ? 'Voir les produits' : 'View product paths'}
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Caption (small, editorial) under the CTAs -->
        <p class="mt-14 text-[11px] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-foreground/55 font-medium">
          {locale === 'cn' ? '供 B2B 采购沟通 · 项目条件以书面方式确认' : locale === 'ja' ? 'B2B 調達のご連絡 · 案件条件は書面で確認' : locale === 'kr' ? 'B2B 소싱 문의 · 프로젝트 조건은 서면 확인' : 'For B2B sourcing — project terms confirmed in writing'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ METRICS BAR（editorial: italic kicker + huge numbers with periods） ============ -->
  <section class="home-proof-band border-y border-border/40 bg-brand-cream/30 py-24 mt-20">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 md:gap-0 md:divide-x md:divide-border/40">
        {c.metrics.map((m, i) => {
          const cv = parseCounter(m.value);
          return (
          <div class={`md:px-8 first:md:pl-0 last:md:pr-0 text-center md:text-left reveal`} data-reveal-delay={i + 1}>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-[11px] md:text-xs text-brand-copper tracking-wide mb-3 uppercase">
              <span class="inline-block">{(i + 1).toString().padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            </p>
            <div class="counter stat-num text-6xl md:text-7xl text-foreground font-serif font-light leading-none mb-3" data-counter={cv.n} data-suffix={cv.s} data-display={m.value}>{m.value}</div>
            <div class="micro-label text-foreground/60">{m.label}</div>
          </div>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ TRUST STRIP (cert badges + stats under hero) ============ -->
  <section class="home-trust-strip py-12 md:py-14 bg-brand-mist/60 border-b border-border/60">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-x-8 gap-y-8 items-center">
        {trustBadges.map((b, i) => (
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 reveal" data-reveal-delay={i + 1}>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-camel mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.25">
              {i % 4 === 0 && <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />}
              {i % 4 === 1 && <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />}
              {i % 4 === 2 && <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />}
              {i % 4 === 3 && <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />}
            </svg>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-ink leading-tight tracking-tight">{b.label[locale] || b.label.en}</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground/70 mt-0.5 leading-tight">{b.sub[locale] || b.sub.en}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============ 原料信息 ============ -->
  <section class="home-origin-section py-20 md:py-28 bg-background overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- 左侧大图（占 7/12） -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative reveal-left">
          <div class="aspect-[3/2] overflow-hidden hover-zoom">
            <img src={IMG.ordosLandscape.url} width={IMG.ordosLandscape.w} height={IMG.ordosLandscape.h} alt="Cashmere sourcing landscape image" class="w-full h-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="lazy" 
          </div>
          <div class="home-origin-detail hidden lg:block">
            <img src={IMG.uiKnit.url} width={IMG.uiKnit.w} height={IMG.uiKnit.h} alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" loading="lazy" 
          </div>
          <!-- 浮动小图（地理坐标装饰） -->
          <div class="hidden md:block absolute -bottom-12 -right-12 w-48 aspect-square overflow-hidden border-8 border-background shadow-2xl bg-brand-cream flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center text-brand-ink">
              <div class="font-serif text-4xl text-brand-gold font-light">{categoryCards.length}</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-display italic text-muted-foreground mt-1">
                {t6('产品路径', 'Product paths', 'Produktwege', 'Voies produit', '製品経路', '제품 경로')}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 右侧文字（占 5/12，错位下沉） -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pl-8 lg:pt-16 reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="1">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-8">
            <span class="eyebrow-label">
              {t6('原料信息', 'Material Information', 'Materialinformationen', 'Informations matière', '原料情報', '원료 정보')}
            </span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-[1.1] mb-8 text-foreground font-display" set:html={t6(
            '鄂尔多斯：<br/>羊绒产品与原料信息',
            'Ordos:<br/>Cashmere Product & Material Information',
            'Ordos:<br/>Kaschmir-Produkt- und Materialinformationen',
            'Ordos :<br/>Informations produit et matière cachemire',
            'オルドス：<br/>カシミア製品と原料情報',
            '오르도스:<br/>캐시미어 제품 및 원료 정보'
          )} />
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
            {t6(
              '请以目录中已列出的材质、颜色、细度与其他规格为起点了解原料；适用的来源、文件与项目要求将结合具体产品书面确认。',
              'Use the material, color, fineness and other specifications listed in the catalog as a starting point for raw-material sourcing; applicable origin, documentation and project requirements are confirmed in writing for the specific product.',
              'Nutzen Sie die im Katalog aufgeführten Material-, Farb-, Feinheits- und weiteren Spezifikationen als Grundlage für die Rohmaterialbeschaffung; geltende Herkunfts-, Dokumentations- und Projektanforderungen werden für das konkrete Produkt schriftlich bestätigt.',
              'Utilisez la matière, la couleur, la finesse et les autres spécifications listées dans le catalogue comme point de départ pour l’approvisionnement matière ; les exigences applicables d’origine, de documentation et de projet sont confirmées par écrit pour le produit concerné.',
              'カタログに記載された素材、色、細度、その他の仕様を原料調達の出発点としてご確認ください。適用される原産地・書類・案件要件は対象製品に応じて書面で確認します。',
              '카탈로그에 기재된 소재, 색상, 섬도 및 기타 사양을 원료 조달의 출발점으로 확인하세요. 적용되는 원산지·서류·프로젝트 요건은 해당 제품에 따라 서면으로 확인됩니다.'
            )}
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
              <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-gold">01</span>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">{t6('已列材质', 'Listed materials', 'Aufgeführte Materialien', 'Matières listées', '記載素材', '기재 소재')}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
              <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-gold">02</span>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">{t6('已列颜色', 'Listed colors', 'Aufgeführte Farben', 'Couleurs listées', '記載カラー', '기재 색상')}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
              <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-gold">03</span>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">{t6('已列规格', 'Listed specifications', 'Aufgeführte Spezifikationen', 'Spécifications listées', '記載仕様', '기재 사양')}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href={`/${locale}/raw-material/`} class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-chocolate font-medium border-b border-brand-chocolate pb-1 hover:border-brand-gold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">
            {t6('查看羊绒原料', 'View raw cashmere materials', 'Rohkaschmir ansehen', 'Voir les matières premières', '原料カシミアを見る', '원료 캐시미어 보기')}
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ Product Range（不对称 Bento 布局） ============ -->
  <section class="home-product-section py-20 md:py-28 bg-brand-cream/50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <!-- 段头 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between mb-16 gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-4">
            <span class="eyebrow-label">
              {t6('产品矩阵', 'Product Range', 'Produktpalette', 'Gamme', '製品範囲', '제품 범위')}
            </span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-[1.1] max-w-2xl font-display">
            {t6(
              '羊绒产品资料：从原料到针织成衣',
              'Cashmere Product Records, from Material to Knitwear',
              'Kaschmir-Produktrecords, von Material bis Strick',
              'Fiches produit cachemire, de la matière à la maille',
              '原料からニットまでのカシミヤ製品資料',
              '원료부터 니트웨어까지의 캐시미어 제품 기록'
            )}
          </h2>
        </div>
        <a href={`/${locale}/products/`} class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-brand-chocolate border-b border-brand-chocolate pb-1 hover:text-brand-gold hover:border-brand-gold transition-colors">
          {t6('查看全部产品', 'View all products', 'Alle ansehen', 'Voir tout', '全て見る', '전체 보기')}
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Grid：左大右小，错落 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <!-- 原料（大图，左 7 列） -->
        <a href={`/${locale}/raw-material/`} class="group md:col-span-7 relative aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-ink via-brand-chocolate to-brand-camel hover-lift reveal" data-reveal-delay="1">
          <img src={IMG.uiMaterial.url} width={IMG.uiMaterial.w} height={IMG.uiMaterial.h} alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="home-material-fill absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="lazy" 
          <!-- 抽象纤维纹理 -->
          <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="fibers-1" x="0" y="0" width="80" height="80" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M0 40 Q20 30, 40 40 T80 40" stroke="#B8956A" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M0 50 Q20 40, 40 50 T80 50" stroke="#B8956A" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M0 30 Q20 20, 40 30 T80 30" stroke="#B8956A" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M0 60 Q20 50, 40 60 T80 60" stroke="#B8956A" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#fibers-1)"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="absolute top-8 right-8 font-serif text-[120px] text-brand-gold/20 font-light leading-none">01</div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-ink/75 via-brand-ink/25 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 text-white">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-display italic text-brand-gold tracking-tight">01 / {t6('原料', 'Material', 'Material', 'Matière', '原料', '원료')}</span>
              <span class="hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto text-xs text-white/70">
                {prodMeta[0].map((m) => (
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span class="text-white/50">{m.tag}</span>
                    <span class="text-white font-medium">{m.value}</span>
                  </span>
                ))}
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light mb-2">
              {t6('羊绒原料', 'Cashmere Raw Material', 'Rohkaschmir', 'Cachemire brut', '原料カシミア', '원료 캐시미어')}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 max-w-md">
              {t6('按单品页查看已列材质、颜色与规格', 'See listed material, color and specification details on product pages', 'Material-, Farb- und Spezifikationsdetails auf Produktseiten ansehen', 'Voir les détails de matière, couleur et spécification sur les fiches produit', '製品ページで記載素材・色・仕様を確認', '제품 페이지에서 기재 소재·색상·사양 확인')}
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- 纱线面料（右小） -->
        <a href={`/${locale}/products/yarn/`} class="group md:col-span-5 relative aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden hover-lift reveal" data-reveal-delay="2">
          <img src={IMG.scarfDetail.url} width={IMG.scarfDetail.w} height={IMG.scarfDetail.h} alt="Cashmere yarn and knitwear detail image" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" decoding="async" loading="lazy" 
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-ink/75 via-brand-ink/25 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 text-white">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
